  "dcat:version": "1.0",
  "dct:description": [
    { "@language": "en", "@value": "GaMS3-12B-Instruct represents the next generation of the GaMS (Generative Model for Slovene) model. The model is based on Google's Gemma 3 family and continually pretrained on Slovene, English, and some portion of Croatian, Serbian, and Bosnian corpora. The supervised fine-tuning phase was done on a combination of Slovene and English datasets." },
    { "@language": "sl", "@value": "GaMS3-12B-Instruct predstavlja naslednjo generacijo modela GaMS (Generativni model za slovenščino). Model temelji na družini Google Gemma 3 in je bil kontinuirano vnaprej naučen na slovenskih, angleških ter deloma hrvaških, srbskih in bosanskih korpusih. Faza nadzorovanega finega uglasbevanja je bila izvedena na kombinaciji slovenskih in angleških naborov podatkov." }
  ],
